        {
          "book": "HEB",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "After the second veil was the tabernacle which is called the Holy of Holies,",
      "ko": "또 둘째 휘장 뒤에 있는 장막을 지성소라 일컫나니",
      "source_text_hash": "dd0b75eb1643a3039d493ac42f7c76e7a1596bc20c9d17ee7ab8825da4b95fd1",
      "translation_text_hash": "b5adf2a289f8672b2a954f246001ba88191010345106ef8e2fd2cb308b8ff144",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "또 둘째 휘장 뒤에 있는 장막을 지성소라 일컫나니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b5adf2a289f8672b2a954f246001ba88191010345106ef8e2fd2cb308b8ff144"
      ]
    },
    {
